[15.197592, "o", "For the purpose of this task, assume that \"European Union countries\" refers to the official EU member states as of 2025-08-16 (the reference date).\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[15.197749, "o", "In the knowledge graph, countries are represented using their two-letter ISO 3166-1 alpha-2 codes as string values.\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> "]
[15.197828, "o", "For example, Greece is represented as \"GR\".\r\n\u001b[?2004l\r\u001b[?2004h> \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
[15.197875, "o", "\u001b[?2004h> The query should return: \r\n\u001b[?2004l\r"]
