[15.527435, "o", "R1_ARM=L R1_ENTRY=implementor R1_ROUTES=coordinator=local,implementor=local,verifier=local,plan=local,implement=local,critique=local,smol=local N1_STEER_ROLE=user N1_NUDGE_AFTER_IDLE=12\r\n"]
[206.714626, "o", "\r\ng = Graph()\r\ng.parse(\"/app/university_graph.ttl\", format=\"turtle\")\r\n\r\nwith open(\"/app/solution.sparql\") as f:\r\n    query = f.read()\r\n\r\nresults = g.query(query)\r\nrows = list(results)\r\nprint(f\"Total results: {len(rows)}\")\r\nfor row in results:\r\n    print(f\"  {row.professorName}: {row.countries}\")\r\nPYEOF — approved\r\n  ⚙ bash python3 << 'PYEOF' from rdflib import Graph g = Graph() g.parse(\"/app/…\r\n    ✓ bash — exit 0\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 31 tool call(s) so far\r\n  qwen3.6-35b — 32 tool call(s) so far\r\n  ⚙ todo \r\n    ✓ todo — 6/6 done\r\nThe query has been saved to `/app/solution.sparql` and verified. It returns 3 professors:\r\n\r\n| Professor | Countries |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Orfeas Menis | GR, US |\r\n| Pepe Attanasio | PT, GR |\r\n| Aristotle Tympas | GR |\r\n\r\n**How the query works:**\r\n\r\n1. **Criterion 1 (Full professor)**: Filters roles starting with \"Professor\" but excluding \"Assistant Professor\".\r\n2. **Criterion 2 (EU department)**: Uses `FILTER EXISTS` to check that at least one department the professor works in belongs to a university in an EU country (27 member states as of 2025-08-16).\r\n3. **Criterion 3 (>10 active students)**: Uses a subquery with `GROUP BY`/`HAVING` to check that at least one department has more than 10 currently enrolled students (enrolled before 2025-08-16 and not graduated before that date).\r\n4. **Country listing**: Collects all countries where the professor works (not just EU countries) via a separate path, then aggregates with `GROUP_CONCAT`.\r\n\r\n**Excluded professors:**\r\n- Athanasios Voulodimos & Stefan Mueller: \"Assistant Professor\" (not full)\r\n- John Smith: Only works in US departments (no EU)\r\n- Marie Dubois: Her only department (Mathematics_Sorbonne) has only 6 active students in Math201 (not >10)\r\n\r\n[result] role=implementor model=qwen3.6-35b tools=32 surface=48cd0ade3676\r\n"]
